  m_Name: InternalCorespondence_2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  pageNumber: 10
  noteTitle: 'Internal 2/4 Emergency Passages:'
  noteContent: "To: Personnel. In case of blockage of main evacuation routes, the
    emergency stairwell remains the only certified method of access between floors.
    The key to the stairwell is in Technicians' Room B. Prof. Kowalski, regarding
    his experiments, mentioned detailed notes concerning possible system overrides
    in his laboratory (Lecture Hall 4, 1st Floor) \u2013 in case of unforeseen reactions
    from his equipment."
